{
 "what": "delta_3 = 117/2192 (Erdos #1186, k = 3): the five certificates, the claimant's verifier logs, its generators, verifier, red and mutation tests, the theorem note, the superseded L-cell ladder's logs and float ceilings, and the pinned sources, ported from frontier-apps/experiments/mono3ap (sessions 34-35) on 2026-10-05.",
 "liftedFrom": "/Users/carlostoledo/Projects/frontier-apps/experiments/mono3ap",
 "liftedOn": "2026-10-05",
 "rule": "Copied byte-for-byte and pinned by sha256; frontier-apps has no git, so the hash is the only pin, and the source tree is read-only from this side. Proof force here comes from instruments/delta3/verify.js, a second verifier written under a CLEAN-ROOM rule from claimant/THEOREM-EXACT.md and CERT-FORMAT.md alone, BEFORE the claimant's code entered this tree: phase 1 (the certificates, the theorem note, the claimant's logs, the sources, the s34 records) preceded the verifier; phase 2 (the claimant's code) followed it. The claimant's verifier is kept as an exhibit and re-run here (certs/delta3/claimant-vcheck-rerun.log); the claimant's logs under certs/delta3/frontier/ enter nothing. No file is patched.",
 "notPorted": {
  "what": "the s34 ladder certificates (superseded; their exact bounds are in the lifted logs and are not re-decided here), the s34 generators and verifier, the SDP caches (inner-sol-*.pkl), mut/ scratch, queue*.sh/*.log, slabs1.log, dslab-best.npy, landscape-L548.npy, .venv, __pycache__, the bench PDF (the paper is rebuilt as paper/tex/delta3.tex; the bench page is rebuilt as tools/build-report-delta3.js and kept only as an exhibit).",
